## Summary of work performed

Two fix iterations on top of the initial implementation:

**Round 1 (21 findings, 1-21):**
- serve.go lifecycle: sync.WaitGroup gates listener goroutine with Shutdown; 0o700 state dir; IdleTimeout=120s.
- MCP handler: StreamableHTTPOptions{SessionTimeout: 5*time.Minute} prevents idle-session leak.
- tmuxnotify: per-call 2s ExecTimeout; ErrTmuxUnavailable vs ErrPaneMissing split via classifyTmuxError; sanitizeSubject strips CR/LF/control chars and truncates to 200.
- store: WAL + busy_timeout(5000) + synchronous(NORMAL) + foreign_keys(on) pragmas; INTEGER unix-nanos timestamps; partial index on (to_repo, posted_at_ns, id) WHERE read_at_ns IS NULL; ListOptions{Limit, SinceID, IncludeRead}; non-nil empty slices.
- tools: dropped dead nil checks; per-field requireFields(); MaxBodyBytes=1 MiB; pagination wired through to MCP.
- CLI: typed server.*Params structs (no map[string]any); dialTimeout/callTimeout constants; defaultEndpoint computed from defaultAddr+mcpPath; resolveBody refactored with io.LimitReader and an injectable stdin.
- Tests: cli/post_test.go (resolveBody matrix), cli/root_test.go (subcommand wiring), durability test (Open, write, close, reopen, assert).

**Round 2 (11 findings):**
- HTTP body cap moved to http.MaxBytesHandler at 4 MiB — protects against pre-SDK io.ReadAll DoS.
- DB pool 1 -> 4 (with WAL fan-out), then later gated by DSN so :memory: stays at 1.
- mergeDefaultPragmas parses query and adds defaults per-pragma; previously a single caller-supplied _pragma suppressed all defaults.
- tmuxnotify drops the list-panes preflight; goes straight to send-keys and classifies the error.
- sanitizeSubject truncates at rune boundaries (utf8.DecodeRuneInString) so multi-byte codepoints aren't split.
- Service.notify: derived context.WithTimeout(Background, 2s) for the prune so client cancellation can't block hygiene. Logs only when removed==true.
- ListMessages gained OmitBody (server-side `"" AS body`); MarkReadBulk added (chunked at 500 ids).
- mark_read_bulk MCP tool + --omit-body and bulk mark in `list --mark-read`.
- cli/serve_test.go: clean-shutdown and bind-failure coverage.

**Round 3 (regression fix for new HIGH from the round-2 reviewer):**
- :memory: DSN + maxOpenConns=4 broke isolation (modernc/sqlite gives each conn a private DB) — added poolSizeFor(dsn) to pin :memory: to 1.
- DeleteSessionByPane closes the TOCTOU window where a re-registration during the post could be clobbered by the prune.
- mark_read_bulk capped at MaxListLimit.
- Replaced hand-rolled UTF-8 decoder in test with unicode/utf8 stdlib.

Final state: `go vet`, `gofmt -s -l .`, and `go test ./... -race -count=1` all clean across four packages.
